# v2 Sigma5 (310)[001] BCC Li -- stage 0: potential & structure sanity check
# Reads the generated data file, loads the OpenKIM SNAP potential and runs
# 0 steps (neighbor build + forces only).  Exits cleanly if the potential
# and the geometry are loadable.
# Usage: lmp -in in.0_check -var outdir ../outputs -var kim_model SNAP_ZuoChenLi_2019_Li__MO_732106099012_000
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data ${outdir}/Sigma5_310.data
pair_style kim ${kim_model}
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms pe etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
run 0
print "STAGE0_CHECK_OK"
